 <h3><u>allah ek hai panjetan paanch hai</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Allah ek hay,Panjetan panch hain Imam barah hain Masoom chohda hain..(3)<br> <br> 1) Pehlay Imam Ali a.s hain Laqab jin ka Murtaza..(2)<br> aur dosray Hassan a.s hain Laqab jin ka mujtaba..(2)<br> aur teesray Hussain a.s Shahanshah e karbala<br> Maa Fatima s.a hain jin ki Laqab jin ka Syeda s.a<br> <br> 2) Chohtay Imam Ali hain Laqab Zain ul Abideen<br> Kehtay hain jin ko Syed e Sajjad Momineen<br> aur ek laqab hay Abid e bemmaar o dil hazeen<br> sajjdon say jin kay ab bhi Munawar hay yeh zameen<br> <br> 3) Hain Panchway Imam Muhammad hay jin ka Naam<br> Baqar laqab say jantay hain in ko khass o aam<br> hay ilm meray panchway aqa ka bhi Ghulam<br> in ko salam kertay hain jibrail subah shaam<br> <br> 4) Hain momino kay Jafar e Sadiq a.s Chatay Imam<br> Jin ka kalaam lagta hay Quran ka kalaam<br> sadiq Imam ko tou hay sach bolnay say kaam<br> hay Fiqh e Jafri ki Shariyat inhi ka naam<br> <br> 5) Aur saathwain Imam ko Kazim a.s laqab mila<br> Mosa hay naam Jafar e sadiq a.s kay laal ka<br> Jo apni pori zindagi bus qaid main raha<br> tou qaid ko bhi sahib e Izzat bana diya<br> <br> 6) Hain Aathwain hain Imam Hamaray ALI RAZA a.s<br> Jin ko Imam e Zamin o Samin Laqab mila<br> Rozay main jin kay ek hay darwaza e shifa<br> Hoti hay her mareez ko sehat wahan ata<br> <br> 7) Apnay Nawain Imam laqab jin ka hay Jawad a.s<br> kertay hain jin ko naam e Muhammad Taqi a.s say yaad<br> Taqwa say jin kay haar gai qoum e bad nehad<br> sub nay samjh liya kay kiya hay nafs say jihaad<br> <br> 8) daswain Imam jin ka hay ism e jali Ali<br> Allah ki taraf say Mila hay laqab Naqi<br> Surat main jin ki baap ka tha husn e munjali<br> seerat main jin kay ai nazar seerat e Nabi saww<br> <br> 9) hain Giyarwain Imam Hassan jin ka naam hay<br> aur Askari laqab hay shah e khass o aam hay<br> yani khudai fouj ka jo intizaam hay<br> Sab in k hath main hay yeh in ka muqam hay<br> <br> 10) aur baarwain Imam zamanay kay tajwaar<br> jo apnay naam say hain payamber ki yaadgaar<br> ek wasf main jo wasf e Khuda say hum kinaar<br> parday main hay Imam tou parday main kirdigaar<br> <br> 11 )majid hay lab pe barah Imamo ka jo bayan<br> main is bayan say dehr main rehta hoon shadmaan<br> hota hay ziker Aqa ka meray jahan jahan<br> Mola kay sadqay ziker hay mera wahan wahan</p> 
